&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Platform Engineer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos du rôle et de l&#39;équipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La &lt;strong&gt;Cloud Platform Engineering (CPE)&lt;/strong&gt; est une Business Unit de près de 200 personnes qui continue de se renforcer pour accompagner les ambitions tech de Decathlon. Notre objectif principal est de rationaliser le catalogue de produits techniques et de fournir des services clé en main pour les équipes IT, afin de leur permettre de se concentrer sur le développement de fonctionnalités à fort impact applicatif.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de la CPE, tu rejoindras l&#39;équipe &lt;strong&gt;Cloud Dev&lt;/strong&gt;. Notre mission est de fournir des fonctionnalités essentielles et abstraites pour le Cloud, en appliquant les meilleures pratiques de développement d&#39;ingénierie logicielle pour unifier, sécuriser et optimiser nos plateformes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu rejoindras une équipe à taille humaine, composée d&#39;ingénieurs passionnés. Nous sommes fans de développement logiciel, d&#39;Infrastructure as Code, de culture DevOps/SRE, d&#39;automatisation, de veille technologique... et bien sûr, de sport !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Périmètre et missions d&#39;un Platform Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que &lt;strong&gt;Platform Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, tu joueras un rôle central dans l&#39;autonomisation des équipes de développement grâce à l&#39;ingénierie de plateforme. Tes missions s&#39;articuleront autour des piliers suivants :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Ingénierie Logicielle &amp;amp; Abstraction Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utiliser les meilleures pratiques de développement (Software Engineering, Software Architecture) pour concevoir du code propre, robuste et maintenable créant des couches d&#39;abstraction au-dessus du Cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer et industrialiser des API, outils internes et modules d&#39;infrastructure en Python et Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consommer et orchestrer des services Serverless (Google Cloud Functions, Google Workflows) et moderniser l&#39;outillage de déploiement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Infrastructure as Code &amp;amp; Automatisation DevSecOps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir, tester et déployer l&#39;infrastructure de manière cohérente et automatisée avec Terraform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construire et optimiser des pipelines CI/CD modernes (de préférence avec GitHub Actions) intégrant les standards de sécurité DevSecOps dès la conception.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automatiser les tâches récurrentes par du scripting (Python, Bash) afin de réduire l&#39;effort manuel et maximiser la fiabilité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Intégration Transversale &amp;amp; Excellence Opérationnelle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer étroitement avec les équipes Réseau, Sécurité et Bases de données pour garantir des intégrations fluides, performantes et sécurisées.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rôle de Run Captain: prendre en charge le support de niveau 2/3, l&#39;analyse des incidents et le traitement des demandes de service pour assurer la stabilité opérationnelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à la définition et au respect des SLO/SLI ainsi qu&#39;à la démarche de réduction du MTTR en automatisant la résolution des problèmes récurrents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Accompagnement, Partage &amp;amp; Culture Produit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger une documentation technique propre et des guides utilisateurs pour faciliter l&#39;adoption des services de plateforme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sensibiliser et former les équipes techniques aux bonnes pratiques d&#39;utilisation des composants développés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à l&#39;animation collective via la gestion agile de nos livrables dans JIRA et promouvoir le partage de connaissances au sein de l&#39;équipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce dont tu auras besoin pour réussir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience &amp;amp; Dév :&lt;/strong&gt; Au moins 3 ans d&#39;expérience en développement Python avec une solide maîtrise des pratiques modernes de génie logiciel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise Cloud :&lt;/strong&gt; Fortes compétences et expérience avérée sur Google Cloud Platform (GCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure as Code &amp;amp; CI/CD :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtrise de Terraform et très bonne pratique des pipelines CI/CD (idéalement GitHub Actions).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scripting &amp;amp; Serverless :&lt;/strong&gt; Bonne connaissance de l&#39;automatisation (Python, Bash) et de l&#39;architecture Serverless / événementielle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills &amp;amp; Esprit d&#39;équipe :&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent relationnel, fort sens de la satisfaction client/utilisateur interne, rigueur dans la documentation et aisance pour résoudre des problèmes complexes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues :&lt;/strong&gt; Anglais maîtrisé à l&#39;oral comme à l&#39;écrit, niveau B2 minimum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un plus apprécié :&lt;/strong&gt; Connaissance pour le langage Go, l&#39;utilisation de Google Workflows ou une certification GCP (Associate Cloud Engineer ou Professional Cloud Developer).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous offrons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esprit d&#39;équipe &amp;amp; Sport :&lt;/strong&gt; Une communauté sportive passionnée et du temps dédié à la pratique du sport.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cadre de travail :&lt;/strong&gt; Possibilité de travailler dans l&#39;un des bureaux de Decathlon Digital à Paris ou Lille et 2 jours de télétravail par semaine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environnement de travail :&lt;/strong&gt; Du matériel récent en accord avec tes missions et tes besoins techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunités &amp;amp; Mobilité :&lt;/strong&gt; Une équipe locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial, offrant des possibilités de carrière à l&#39;international.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement professionnel :&lt;/strong&gt; Accompagnement continu dans le développement de tes compétences (diversité des projets, certifications, formations internes et externes…).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Package de rémunération :&lt;/strong&gt; Package attractif incluant la participation des employés aux actions de l&#39;entreprise ainsi que des bonus mensuels, trimestriels et annuels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Value Engineering is responsible for our largest Fortune 500 customers and owns their transformation journey by working on the very frontier of what’s possible with data and AI on the Celons Platform. Partnering closely with the Sales team, Value Engineering is responsible for ensuring that the Celonis Platform is deployed to tackle the most strategic business challenges, fits into the right place in our customers’ technology stack and most importantly generates strong ROI through deep and broad deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Value Engineer, you will spearhead AI and data-driven business transformation by contributing to your customer’s end-to-end value journey using the Celonis Context Model. Working alongside Lead and Principal VEs, you will combine technical execution with consulting and project management. As an AI-fluent operator, your core mandate is to orchestrate complex roadmaps and execute targeted transformation initiatives that improve how these businesses operate across their ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling &amp;amp; Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover the real issues by peeling back layers of organizational complexity. Own the Outcome from first discovery through realized ROI for your process areas. Tell the Value Story by crafting powerful executive narratives and leading business value workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate powerful executive sponsorship across core business units to champion transformation programs. Co-own change management with customer leaders and design CoE roadmaps that build self-sufficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer Global Transformations across complex workstreams. Own and implement AI-driven account planning and AI-assisted project management. Automate executive governance (QBRs, SteerCos) with minimal manual friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI tools for rapid technical outputs while partnering with Applied Value Engineers for deep-dive solution builds. Champion platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a strategic expansion roadmap embedding Celonis as a strategic platform to drive adoption. Provide feedback to R&amp;amp;D based on evolving customer use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience taking ownership of complex workstreams, process areas, and customer relationships in Value Engineering, Consulting, or Pre-Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Technical &amp;amp; Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid background in enterprise IT and business software (e.g., SAP, Workday, Salesforce, Oracle). You operate primarily as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI copilots to generate outputs and automations, avoiding heavy manual coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable setting your own direction within an account team. Driven to &lt;em&gt;live for customer value&lt;/em&gt;, proactively hunting and ideating for highest-impact solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven expertise in executing process improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Program &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated expertise orchestrating multi-region or business unit transformation programs. Expert at mobilizing VP/Director-level sponsorship. Flawless English communication with commanding executive presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the Finance/Supply Chain domains. You stay continuously updated on business-critical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, Business Analytics,&amp;nbsp; comparable technical degree or a Business/Economics degree paired with a technical minor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nebius Managed Kubernetes (mk8s) mission is to grow the Nebius cloud platform by providing a Kubernetes-native way to run AI systems with high efficiency and low operational overhead.&amp;nbsp;With a single click, it provides a Kubernetes cluster on top of Nebius services for compute (VMs) and networking.&amp;nbsp;In 2026, the service is scaling 10× and is expected to manage customer workloads across tens of thousands of GPU servers in more than 10 data centers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the mk8s Core team, one of three mk8s teams. The Core team owns the API, the core of the service control plane, cluster autoscaling, platform integrations, and running k8s add-ons.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Nebius, team leads are hands-on. We expect you to be a senior or staff engineer now (or earlier in your career). You will start as an individual contributor to gain context, then take on managerial responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you will be responsible to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead by example.&lt;/strong&gt; Set the quality bar by spending a significant portion of your time on IC work: writing and reviewing code, leading projects, and participating in on-call rotation, incident mitigation, and post-incident analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage 4–8 mid-to-senior engineers.&lt;/strong&gt; Provide context, coach, and give regular feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain the technical vision&lt;/strong&gt; for your area of responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with the Product Manager and Service Owner&lt;/strong&gt; to shape product vision and plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Examples of outcomes you could drive as a Team Lead&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize the service control plane to create and manage 20K GPU nodes in a single Kubernetes cluster, enabling a major contract for the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate cluster autoscaling approaches (e.g., Karpenter) to improve resource utilization and support seamless auto-upgrades.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide a Kubernetes-native way to use local disks to reduce disk I/O bottlenecks for AI training and inference, improving efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver managed Layer 7 load balancers to reduce operational overhead for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
