&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Intermediate Fullstack Engineer (Ruby/Vue.js), Growth at GitLab, you&#39;ll help turn GitLab&#39;s self-serve funnel into a reliable source of new paying customers. You&#39;ll work on the in-product journey from a user&#39;s first visit through sign-up, trial, and first purchase, on both GitLab.com and self-managed GitLab. You&#39;ll collaborate closely with Product Managers, UX Designers, and Data Analysts, with a particular focus on backend development in Ruby on Rails and frontend work in Vue.js. This role gives you the opportunity to combine your fullstack engineering skills with product thinking and experimentation, shipping small changes quickly and measuring their impact on real customer outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/engineering/development/growth/&quot;&gt;Some examples of our projects:&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Making it easier for self-managed users to try and buy GitLab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Building upgrade prompts where users run into paid features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Improving the trial experience, including trials of GitLab Duo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Improving the tooling the team uses to run and read out experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Design, build, and iterate on A/B tests and experiments that increase first purchases on GitLab.com and self-managed GitLab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Build and improve registration, trial, onboarding, and in-product upgrade and purchase experiences to increase completion of these steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Implement backend features and services in Ruby on Rails and frontend experiences using Vue.js.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Analyze experiment results and product usage data with Data Analysts to decide which changes to keep, iterate on, or roll back based on first-purchase outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Product Managers and UX Designers to define hypotheses and success metrics before shipping experiments, then compare results against those metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Maintain and improve our experimentation framework and tooling to increase experiment throughput and reduce the time from setup to results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Collaborate with other Engineering teams, including Fulfillment, to remove purchase barriers across GitLab’s codebase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Document decisions, review code, and share experiment results asynchronously so distributed teammates can track shipped changes and their measured outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Professional experience developing with Ruby on Rails and modern JavaScript, along with solid Git, feature development, and deployment workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Experience working with relational databases and a solid understanding of web performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;A track record of shipping features to production and owning them after release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Ability to use product data to decide what to build, keep, or roll back.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Ability to document decisions and share updates asynchronously with distributed Product Management, UX, and Data teammates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Ability to organize your work, seek and apply feedback, and collaborate inclusively with teammates from diverse backgrounds, in line with GitLab’s values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Preferred, not required: experience with Vue.js, PostgreSQL, A/B testing, feature flags, experimentation frameworks, or SaaS sign-up, trial, billing, or checkout flows. We&#39;ll help you learn our tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re GitLab’s Growth team: one team with one roadmap, prioritizing work by how directly it helps people buy. We work fully remotely and asynchronously across multiple regions, guided by GitLab’s values of transparency and iteration. Our challenge is running more high-impact experiments, faster, while coordinating changes with teams like Fulfillment and Pricing across the parts of the product they own. For more on how we work, see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/engineering/development/growth/&quot;&gt;Growth&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/product/&quot;&gt;Product&lt;/a&gt; sections of the GitLab handbook.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At euNetworks, Finance plays a critical role in supporting strategic decision-making, driving commercial performance and enabling sustainable business growth. As a leading European provider of high-capacity fibre network infrastructure and Data Centre to Data Centre connectivity, euNetworks operates in a dynamic, investment-intensive market where robust financial planning and analysis are essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;euNetworks is seeking a commercially-minded Senior Director of Financial Planning &amp;amp; Analysis to lead financial planning, forecasting, performance reporting and business partnering across the business. Reporting directly to the Chief Financial Officer, this role will take ownership of monthly financial reporting and deliver high-quality financial insights to the Board and ExCo to shape strategy and drive performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with commercial and operational stakeholders, the Senior Director will act as a trusted business partner, translating financial data into actionable insights that support revenue growth, cost management and investment decisions. The role will also work closely with Business Operations to strengthen commercial performance analysis, forecasting and alignment between financial plans and sales objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity for an experienced finance leader with a strong commercial finance background to influence business strategy and drive financial performance across a growing European digital infrastructure business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Planning &amp;amp; Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the FP&amp;amp;A function, overseeing financial planning, budgeting, forecasting and performance analysis across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop and motivate a high-performing FP&amp;amp;A team, setting clear objectives and building the capability needed to support the business&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the monthly financial reporting process, ensuring accurate, timely and insightful reporting of financial performance against budget, forecast and prior periods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse financial results, identify key trends and variances, and provide recommendations to improve business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously enhance financial models, reporting processes and analytical tools to improve the quality and efficiency of financial decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Board &amp;amp; ExCo Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the preparation and delivery of financial reporting and performance analysis for the Board and ExCo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex financial information into clear, concise insights, highlighting key business drivers, risks, opportunities and recommended actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support senior leadership with financial analysis for strategic initiatives, investment decisions and business planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistency, accuracy and alignment across management reporting, financial forecasts and executive presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Finance &amp;amp; Business Partnering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted finance partner to senior stakeholders, providing commercial insight and constructive challenge to support business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate revenue performance, margins, operating costs and investment priorities to identify opportunities for growth and improved profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with functional leaders to assess financial performance, challenge assumptions and ensure accountability against agreed business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business strategy into financial plans, performance measures and actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecasting &amp;amp; Financial Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development and ongoing management of financial forecasts, budgets and long-range financial plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate forecasting activities across relevant business functions, ensuring assumptions reflect commercial priorities and operational requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess forecast accuracy, identify emerging risks and opportunities, and recommend appropriate corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scenario analyses and financial models to support strategic planning, investment decisions and business performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Operations &amp;amp; Commercial Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Business Operations to align financial forecasts with sales pipelines, revenue expectations and commercial targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide financial analysis of sales performance, customer revenue, pipeline conversion and commercial opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of reporting and analytical tools that improve visibility of sales performance and revenue trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales and Commercial teams to strengthen forecasting accuracy, performance accountability and alignment between sales plans and financial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we want &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;from &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading FP&amp;amp;A commercial finance functions, ideally within a complex, international B2B business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A recognised professional accounting qualification (e.g. ACA, ACCA, CIMA) or equivalent preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong commercial finance background, with a proven ability to translate financial data into actionable business insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning monthly management reporting, budgeting, forecasting and financial performance analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience preparing financial reports and presentations for Board and ExCo audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable business partnering experience, including the ability to challenge and influence senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with Business Operations or commercial teams to support revenue forecasting, pipeline analysis and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial modelling, analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to interpret complex data and identify business trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication and presentation skills, with the ability to explain financial performance and recommendations clearly to non-finance stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership, organisational and project management skills, with the ability to manage competing priorities and deliver to tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in financial planning, reporting and analytical systems, alongside strong Excel and presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, commercially-minded and collaborative approach, with a strong focus on accuracy, accountability and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Telecommunications, Digital Infrastructure, Technology or another capital-intensive industry would be advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this position is of interest but you don’t think you meet all of the criteria listed, please still consider applying. euNetworks looks to recruit people with the right attitude, potential and ambition and for the right candidate, we will provide further training and support to enable you to develop in the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can we offer you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At euNetworks we invest in our people by offering a range of benefits and development opportunities designed to support your professional growth and personal wellbeing. Employees have access to a comprehensive wellbeing programme that promotes mental health and also recognises the importance of work-life balance through initiatives such as a dedicated birthday day off and “give back” days to support volunteering activities. euNetworks’ bonus scheme is linked to both individual contribution and overall company performance with opportunity to overachieve in both areas. In addition, euNetworks operates a flexible hybrid working policy, enabling employees to balance in-office collaboration with remote work, fostering productivity, autonomy and a positive employee experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Family Friendly Policy delivers enhanced and inclusive parental benefits that can viewed &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1yM2VvLsByNiULKnRX9pIksCK0GI6FmO2/edit?usp=sharing&amp;amp;ouid=105588911760161167743&amp;amp;rtpof=true&amp;amp;sd=true&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Insurances, pensions, leave and additional enhancements are modelled to work with local country provisions, please email &lt;a ---------- for more details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our company values drive our behaviour and form the basis of how we operate our business. We work as a team promoting a culture of collaboration, trust and respect where every individual is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer and commit to providing each individual with the support, continued learning and the tools to achieve their goals and an environment in which they can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to make the hiring process equitable and accessible for all. Providing candidates with the opportunity to be their true selves and explore how you might thrive at euNetworks. We are a recognised Disability Confident employer and will make provisions where possible to support you through the interview process, if you require any reasonable accommodation through the selection process, please let your Talent Partner know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;euNetworks is a pan-European provider of bandwidth infrastructure services and a vital enabler of Cloud and AI adoption. We’re the leading connectivity partner for data centre companies and their customers in Europe, directly connecting over 600 data centres today. We own and operate 18 metropolitan city networks connected with a high capacity intercity backbone covering 53 cities in 17 countries. A leading provider of cloud connectivity, we&amp;nbsp;directly connect to all major cloud platforms.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Brief&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior DevOps Platform Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a key role in building and evolving the Software Platform capabilities used across Ground Systems. You will enable engineering teams with scalable, secure, and efficient development workflows while continuously improving developer productivity and software delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Specifically, this is a hands-on platform engineering role with a strong infrastructure core. Your mission is to own the runtime that Ground Systems software runs on both the on-premise Kubernetes clusters and the cloud services around them and the developer experience of getting software onto it. You will design cluster architecture, build the automation that provisions and maintains clusters across environments, and maintain the reusable delivery platform (GitLab CI/CD library, container toolchains, Helm charts, IaC modules) that product teams consume.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role in our Space Mission...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Own and continuously evolve software platform capabilities enabling secure, reliable, and efficient software delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design and evolve the architecture of on-premise and cloud-hosted Kubernetes clusters and the surrounding platform: control-plane/worker topology, networking, storage, secrets management, and multi-environment promotion models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Make and document architecture decisions as ADRs and standards that other teams build against, balancing reliability, operability, cost, and delivery speed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build and maintain automation that initialize, upgrades, and recovers clusters end to end as well as certificate lifecycle, node drains and upgrades, storage provisioning and incident management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provision the on-premise and cloud-hosted substrate with Terraform and configure it with Ansible: HAProxy load balancers, NFS shares, DNS/resolv, secondary disks, domain joins.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage workloads with Helm: author, version, and maintain charts for application services and stateful components (Kafka, ClickHouse, MQTT brokers, MSSQL), with automated semVer releases driven from merge requests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Practice GitOps with ArgoCD: installation, Azure Entra ID SSO and RBAC, and reconciliation troubleshooting across clusters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;Own shared GitLab CI/CD library for jobs, templates, rules, semVer/release/changelog automation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;Operate developer-facing platform tooling and the container toolchain behind those pipelines including observability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you´ll need to thrive...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;5+ years in Platform Engineering, DevOps, Software Infrastructure or SRE-type roles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong Linux proficiency, comfortable on the shell, troubleshooting systemd, networking, DNS, storage, permissions and file systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
